(SMARTGYM FIREBASE GUIDE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SmartGym uses Firebase Realtime Database as the backend for user profiles, calibration) Tj
T*
(data, session history, summaries, dashboard charts, and device heartbeat.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Safety Warning) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Do not import a full JSON file at the Firebase root unless you intentionally want to) Tj
T*
(replace the entire database.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Do not commit database secrets, service account files, private auth tokens, Wi-Fi) Tj
T*
(passwords, or local `.env` files. Public Firebase web config should still be) Tj
T*
(restricted with proper Firebase rules and domain/app restrictions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Safer import pattern:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Import user JSON at `usersByRfid`.) Tj
T*
(- Import calibration JSON at `calibrations`.) Tj
T*
(- Import machine config JSON at `machineConfigs`.) Tj
T*
(- Import session data at the matching `athleteWeeklySessions/{uid}/{weekKey}` node.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Main RTDB Nodes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(usersByRfid) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```text) Tj
T*
(usersByRfid/{uid}) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Stores RFID-linked user profile data such as display name, age, height, weight,) Tj
T*
(gender, and preferred goal.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Profile reads happen during RFID user sync. Profile writes should only happen for) Tj
T*
(explicit profile edits or intentional compatibility fields.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(calibrations) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```text) Tj
T*
(calibrations/{uid}/{machineTypeId}) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Stores user-machine calibration data:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Has calibration flag.) Tj
T*
(- Suggested/recommended load.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
